KPL/SCLK
Two clocks for the tests of myb/ck.h (cspice_ck.py). 9099: three fields, two partitions,
times on TDB with a jump and two changes of the rate. 9098: two fields, the second counted
from 1, one partition that starts at the count 100, times on TT.
